            >
            <span
              class="text-slate-500 transition-all duration-300 transform font-mono text-lg icon-rotate"
              >＋</span
            >
          </button>
          <div
            class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out faq-content"
            style="max-height: 0px;"
          >
            <p
              class="p-6 pt-0 text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-800/50 italic"
            >
              Las faucets de <b class="text-emerald-500">Testnet</b> entregan tokens
              sin valor real para probar dApps. Las de <b class="text-cyan-500"
                >Mainnet</b
              > entregan criptomonedas reales (como Satoshis o SOL), generalmente
              a cambio de ver anuncios o completar tareas sencillas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
